# Simple OS – protection and maintenance in the background (settings: hook 12_system_services, Control Center)
# Firewall: incoming all closed, outgoing open; printer discovery (mDNS) and UPnP are allowed by ufw's default rules
ufw
# When memory is full, end the largest program instead of the computer freezing for minutes
earlyoom
# Power profiles (Power saver / Balanced / Performance, Control Center → Power); thermald keeps Intel CPUs cool
power-profiles-daemon
thermald
# BIOS/firmware updates from LVFS (Lenovo, Dell, HP …) via Software Updates; signed EFI part for Secure Boot
fwupd
fwupd-amd64-signed
